Remove Nth Node From End of Linked List
(Gap Pattern + Dummy Node)
📌 Problem Statement

Singly Linked List di hui hai

End se nth node delete karni hai

Single traversal (one pass) me solve karna hai

🧠 Core Idea (Gap Pattern)

Do pointers use karte hain: fast & slow

fast ko n steps aage move karte hain

slow wahi rehta hai

Dono ko saath-saath move karte hain

Jab fast last node par hota hai →
slow delete hone wali node ke just pehle hota hai

🤖 Why Dummy Node?

Head node delete hone ka edge case handle hota hai

Head bhi normal node ban jata hai

Extra if-else conditions avoid hoti hain

Code clean aur uniform rehta hai
